### 3. Comments Auto-Hide & Header Toggle Settings
- **File**: [NotionNestPage.tsx](file:///c:/BriselleServer/Briselle-Lightiningv58/briselle-lightining.client/src/modules/notion-nest/pages/NotionNestPage.tsx)
  - Added a comment-settings dropdown to the page header (rendered next to the save button).
  - Toggles `commentsAlwaysShow` (boolean) and configures `autoHideDelay` (30s, 60s, 90s, 120s), persisting preferences in `localStorage`.
- **File**: [NotionPage.jsx](file:///c:/BriselleServer/Briselle-Lightiningv58/briselle-lightining.client/src/modules/notion-nest/NotionPage.jsx)
  - Implemented the visibility timer inside `NotionPageInner` component.
  - Sidebar remains visible if `commentsAlwaysShow` is active, or if a comment highlight is hovered, a card is active, a draft comment exists, or the comment region itself is hovered.
  - Otherwise, starts a timeout matching the configured auto-hide delay and adds `.comments-hidden` classes upon expiration.
- **File**: [menus.jsx](file:///c:/BriselleServer/Briselle-Lightiningv58/briselle-lightining.client/src/modules/notion-nest/menus.jsx)
  - Updated `NotionPageTextComment` to accept `visible` and `onHoverChange` callbacks, binding mouse listeners to the sidebar container.
- **CSS Files**: [NotionPage.css](file:///c:/BriselleServer/Briselle-Lightiningv58/briselle-lightining.client/src/modules/notion-nest/NotionPage.css) and [notion-nest.css](file:///c:/BriselleServer/Briselle-Lightiningv58/briselle-lightining.client/src/modules/notion-nest/notion-nest.css)
  - Added smooth transitions for sidebar fade-out (`opacity` and `pointer-events`) and content margin contraction.
  - Styled the new header settings dropdown, checkbox tick icons, dividers, and active timer options.

