### Browser Testing

All features verified interactively at `http://localhost:5173/notion/1000000001/100000000004`:
- **Status:** ✅ Completed Successfully
- **Command:** `npm run build`
- **Details:** The project compiles into the production bundle (`dist/`) successfully with all dependencies (including `lucide-react`) without any errors.

### Interactive Verification
Verified interactively inside the browser dev instance:
- Emoji, check, and more options sit inline in the top-right corner of the card and don't spill or block text.
- Upload tab opens the browser file picker successfully.
- Mention items correctly insert values (e.g. ` @Today` or ` @Feedback #5 & 6`) into the active reply input without losing input focus.
- Resolved comments stay in the sidebar, rendered with greyed opacity, and can be unresolved at any time.
- Resolved inline highlights appear as subtle dashed lines in the document body.

